OL,3,AMan shot during 2024 Trump campaign
OL,4,Arally in Butler dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the three attendees who was shot
OL,7,Fat Donald Trump's 2024 presidential
OL,8,Fcampaign rally in Butler, Pennsylvania,
OL,9,Fhas passed away from complications
OL,10,Fstemming from his injuries, according
OL,11,Fto the Pennsylvania attorney general.
OL,13,FJim Copenhaver, 76, was struck twice
OL,14,Fwhen a gunman opened fire from a nearby
OL,15,Frooftop. Another attendee, Corey
OL,16,FComperatore, was killed in the shooting
OL,17,Fand Trump's ear was grazed by a bullet.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
