OL,3,AMan shot during 2024 Trump campaign
OL,4,Arally in Butler dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FCopenhaver died on Wednesday at a
OL,7,Fhospital in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania,
OL,8,Faccording to a statement from the
OL,9,FAllegheny County medical examiner
OL,10,Fshared with local media.
OL,12,FThe gunman, 20-year-old Thomas Crooks,
OL,13,Fwas killed by Secret Service after he
OL,14,Fopened fire.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
